---
---

<section id="about" class="section about-section">
  <div class="section-container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-eyebrow"><i class="fas fa-sparkles"></i> Background</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">About Me &amp; Tech Stack</h2>
      <p class="section-description">Turning complex supercomputing research and multi-modal AI into high-performance production systems</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="about-grid">
      <!-- Bio & Education Column -->
      <div class="about-content">
        <div class="bio-card glass-card">
          <h3 class="bio-heading"><i class="fas fa-terminal text-sky-500"></i> Engineering Philosophy</h3>
          <p>
            I am a <strong>Machine Learning Engineer</strong> and <strong>Data Scientist</strong> with an MSc in Computer Science &amp; Engineering from 
            <strong>Eindhoven University of Technology (TU/e)</strong>. My focus is at the intersection of production-ready AI systems, reinforcement learning, 
            deep learning (YOLOv8, CodeT5), and high-performance computing.
          </p>
          
          <p>
            Currently at <strong>Supercomputing Brabant</strong> (AI Supercomputing Initiative Brabant - AI-SIB) at <strong>TU Eindhoven</strong>, 
            I engineer solutions on the <strong>Spike-A supercomputer</strong>, scaling high-performance AI infrastructure, distributed deep learning models, 
            and compute optimization for organizations and researchers across the Brabant innovation ecosystem. We democratize supercomputing—connecting 
            researchers and regional industry partners with high-throughput multi-GPU capabilities.
          </p>
          
          <p>
            Previously at <strong>Vencomatic Group</strong> (Nov 2025 – Jun 2026), I engineered automated data pipelines and 
            interactive Streamlit dashboards analyzing telemetry. As Co-Founder &amp; CTO of <strong>Loopit.ai</strong>, I directed a 12-engineer team developing an automated vehicle damage detection platform 
            powered by custom YOLOv8 models, earning the prestigious <strong>€1,000 EAISI AI Incentive Award</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Supercomputing Brabant Team & Event Spotlight -->
        <div class="team-spotlight-card glass-card mt-3">
          <div class="team-spotlight-header">
            <span class="spotlight-badge"><i class="fas fa-server"></i> Current Role</span>
            <span class="spotlight-tag">TU Eindhoven</span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="team-spotlight-title">Supercomputing Brabant // Meet the Team</h4>
          <div class="timeline-media team-spotlight-media" title="Click to enlarge photo">
            <img 
              src="assets/news/supercomputing-brabant-team.jpg" 
              alt="Meet the Team: Supercomputing Brabant at TU Eindhoven launch event" 
              loading="lazy" 
              decoding="async" 
              width="600" 
              height="350" 
            />
            <span class="media-zoom-pill"><i class="fas fa-magnifying-glass-plus"></i> Enlarge Photo</span>
          </div>
          <p class="team-spotlight-desc">
            With colleagues representing <strong>Supercomputing Brabant</strong> at our regional event at TU Eindhoven. We operate the <strong>Spike-A supercomputer</strong>, supporting research groups and high-tech industry across Brabant with distributed deep learning, multi-GPU optimization, and sovereign European compute.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Education Cards -->
        <div class="education-group mt-4">
          <h3 class="group-title"><i class="fas fa-graduation-cap"></i> Academic Credentials</h3>
          <div class="education-cards">
            <div class="edu-card glass-card">
              <img src="assets/logos/tue.png" alt="TU Eindhoven University of Technology Logo" class="edu-logo" width="48" height="48" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              <div>
                <h4>MSc Computer Science &amp; Engineering</h4>
                <p>Eindhoven University of Technology (TU/e)</p>
                <span>2023 – 2025 • GPA 7.12/10 • Netherlands</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="edu-card glass-card">
              <img src="assets/logos/jmi.png" alt="Jamia Millia Islamia University Logo" class="edu-logo" width="48" height="48" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              <div>
                <h4>BTech Computer Engineering</h4>
                <p>Jamia Millia Islamia University</p>
                <span>2019 – 2023 • Grade 8.54/10 • New Delhi, India</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Tech Stack Bento Grid -->
      <div class="bento-skills-grid">
        <!-- Bento 1: Supercomputing & AI-SIB -->
        <div class="bento-box glass-card featured-box">
          <div class="bento-header">
            <div class="bento-icon-badge purple">
              <i class="fas fa-server"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4>Supercomputing Brabant &amp; Spike-A</h4>
              <span class="bento-sub">Regional High-Tech AI Compute // TU/e &amp; Brabant</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="skill-pills">
            <span>Supercomputing Brabant</span>
            <span>Spike-A Cluster</span>
            <span>Distributed Deep Learning</span>
            <span>GPU Orchestration</span>
            <span>CUDA &amp; Slurm</span>
            <span>PyTorch Distributed</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Bento 2: AI & Deep Learning -->
        <div class="bento-box glass-card">
          <div class="bento-header">
            <div class="bento-icon-badge blue">
              <i class="fas fa-brain"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4>AI &amp; Deep Learning</h4>
              <span class="bento-sub">Models, Vision &amp; LLMs</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="skill-pills">
            <span>PyTorch</span>
            <span>TensorFlow</span>
            <span>YOLOv8</span>
            <span>Reinforcement Learning</span>
            <span>CodeT5</span>
            <span>Scikit-learn</span>
            <span>OpenCV</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Bento 3: Data & Pipelines -->
        <div class="bento-box glass-card">
          <div class="bento-header">
            <div class="bento-icon-badge emerald">
              <i class="fas fa-database"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4>Data &amp; Telemetry</h4>
              <span class="bento-sub">Production Pipelines</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="skill-pills">
            <span>Python</span>
            <span>SQL Server</span>
            <span>Azure</span>
            <span>PostgreSQL</span>
            <span>Streamlit</span>
            <span>Time-Series</span>
            <span>Knowledge Graphs</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Bento 4: DevOps & Edge -->
        <div class="bento-box glass-card">
          <div class="bento-header">
            <div class="bento-icon-badge amber">
              <i class="fas fa-server"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4>DevOps &amp; Edge Deployment</h4>
              <span class="bento-sub">Cloud &amp; Embedded</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="skill-pills">
            <span>Docker</span>
            <span>Kubernetes</span>
            <span>FastAPI</span>
            <span>AWS</span>
            <span>Git</span>
            <span>CI/CD</span>
            <span>Linux</span>
            <span>Edge AI</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .bio-card {
    padding: 1.25rem 1.4rem;
    border-radius: 14px;
  }

  .bio-heading {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  /* Supercomputing Brabant Team Spotlight Card */
  .team-spotlight-card {
    padding: 1.15rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 14px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25);
    background: var(--card-bg);
    margin-top: 1rem;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px var(--shadow);
  }

  .team-spotlight-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .spotlight-badge {
    font-size: 0.725rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: #a855f7;
    background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.25);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 50px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .spotlight-tag {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .team-spotlight-title {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
  }

  .team-spotlight-media {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    cursor: pointer;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    max-height: 220px;
    background: var(--bg);
  }

  .team-spotlight-media img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-height: 220px;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 25%;
    display: block;
    transition: transform 0.35s ease;
  }

  .team-spotlight-media:hover img {
    transform: scale(1.03);
  }

  .team-spotlight-desc {
    font-size: 0.835rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin-top: 0.65rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .about-content p {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .about-content p:last-of-type {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .about-content p strong {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .group-title {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--text);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .education-cards {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .edu-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.65rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
  }

  .edu-logo {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    object-fit: contain;
    background: #ffffff;
    padding: 4px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px var(--shadow);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .edu-card:hover .edu-logo {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .edu-card h4 {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .edu-card p {
    font-size: 0.775rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 0.05rem;
  }

  .edu-card span {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  /* Bento Grid */
  .bento-skills-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  .bento-box {
    padding: 1rem 1.15rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .bento-box.featured-box {
    border-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--card-bg) 0%, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.04) 100%);
  }

  .bento-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .bento-icon-badge {
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .bento-icon-badge.purple {
    background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.15);
    color: #a855f7;
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3);
  }

  .bento-icon-badge.blue {
    background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15);
    color: #38bdf8;
    border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3);
  }

  .bento-icon-badge.emerald {
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
    color: #10b981;
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
  }

  .bento-icon-badge.amber {
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15);
    color: #f59e0b;
    border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
  }

  .bento-header h4 {
    font-size: 0.925rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .bento-sub {
    font-size: 0.725rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .skill-pills {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .skill-pills span {
    padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text);
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .skill-pills span:hover {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #ffffff;
    border-color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
